# Hook entry points run under bash, also on Windows (Git Bash). A checkout with CRLF line
# endings (core.autocrlf=true) breaks them with "$'\r': command not found", so the hooks would
# stop silently. Keep them LF everywhere. This file is part of the release tree.
hooks/** text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=lf
